    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Represents 11,984 restricted stock units granted to the Reporting Person under the Issuer's 2017 Equity Incentive Plan, as amended (the &quot;Plan&quot;), in connection with the Reporting Person's service as a director of the Issuer, which restricted stock units are subject to vesting conditions.</footnote>
